        {
          "id": "d-730339a6f12064a3/b10_0008",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "Jean-Jacques  Kiladjian  (Investigation,  Validation,  Visualization, Writing-review & editing), Uma Borate (Investigation, Writingreview & editing), Elisabetta Abruzzese (Investigation, Writing-review  &  editing),  Valerio  De  Stefano  (Investigation, Writing-review & editing), Tiejun Gong (Investigation, Writingreview  &  editing),  Massimo  Breccia  (Investigation,  Writing-review  &  editing),  Francesca  Palandri  (Investigation,  Writingreview  &  editing),  Fabrizio  Pane  (Investigation,  Writing-review &  editing),  Andrea  Patriarca  (Investigation,  Writing-review  & editing),  Hakon  Reikvam  (Investigation,  Writing-review  &  editing), Lindsay Rein (Investigation, Writing-review & editing), Abdulraheem Yacoub (Conceptualization, Investigation, Visualization, Writingreview  &  editing),  Feng  Zhou  (Data  curation,  Formal  analysis, Software, Visualization, Writing-original draft, Writing-review & editing), Michael Stouffs (Conceptualization, Data curation, Funding acquisition, Methodology, Supervision, Visualization, Writing-original  draft,  Writing-review  &  editing),  Albert  Assad (Conceptualization, Data curation, Funding acquisition, Methodology,  Supervision,  Visualization,  Writing-original  draft, Writing-review & editing), and Alessandro Maria Vannucchi (Investigation, Writing-review & editing)",
