          "text": "Incyte Corporation, Rigel, Servier, Sumitomo,  and Syndax; served on a steering committee for Kura and Sumitomo; served on an independent data monitoring committee for Janssen and Takeda.  E.A.:  Consultancy  for  Ascentage,  BMS,  GSK,  Incyte, Novartis, Pfizer, Takeda. V.D.S.: Honoraria from, advisory board or speakers bureau for AbbVie, AOP-Health, BMS, GSK, Novartis, Sobi.  T.G.:  No  relevant  conflicts  of  interest  to  declare.  M.B.: Honoraria  from  AbbVie,  AOP,  BMS,  GSK,  Incyte  Corporation, Novartis, Otsuka, and Servier. F. Palandri: Consultancy and honoraria from AOP, BMS, GSK, Incyte Corporation, Novartis, Sanofi, Sobi,  and  Takeda.  F.  Pane:  Honoraria  from  Incyte  Corporation and Novartis; speakers bureau for BMS, Novartis, and Pfizer. A. P.:  Honoraria  from  Alexion,  BMS,  Incyte  Corporation,  Novartis, Pfizer, Recordati Sanofi, Sobi, and Takeda. Other financial relationships:  Alexion  Hospitality  at  ASH  2022,  Sobi  Hospitality  at ASH 2023, Sanofi Hospitality at EHA 2022, Sanofi Hospitality at EHA 2021. H.R.: Consultancy and honoraria from: GSK, Hemanext, and Novartis. L.R.: No relevant conflicts of interest to declare. A.Y.: Advisory role for AbbVie, Acceleron Pharma, Apellis,  Blueprint  Medicine,  CTI  Pharma,  Gilead,  GSK,  Incyte Corporation, Karyopharm Therapeutics, Notable Labs, Novartis, Pharmaessentia, Pfizer, Protagonist, and Servier. Research funding  from  Menarini-Stemline  and Sobi. F.Z., M.S., and  A.A.: Employment by and stock ownership in Incyte Corporation. A.M. V.:  Honoraria  from  and/or  advisory  board  for  AOP,  GSK,  Incyte Corporation, Italfarmaco, Menarini Stemline, and Novartis; Research support from Lonctura.",
